# The vendored engine prompts are pinned by SHA-256 in
# `datasets/vendor/skillopt_prompts.lock.json`, and the digest is of the bytes.
# `core.autocrlf` is true on at least one machine here, which would rewrite
# every line ending on checkout and fail the check on a clean clone while
# passing on the machine that committed them. `-text` means git does not touch
# these files in either direction.
datasets/vendor/skillopt-prompts/** -text
